     "text": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\nclass Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    A class to solve the Maximum Subarray problem using Kadane's algorithm.\n    This implementation follows the latest coding guidelines provided by the mentor,\n    including consistent naming conventions, clear documentation, and maintainable code.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def max_subarray(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Finds the maximum sum of any contiguous subarray within the given list of integers.\n\n        Args:\n            nums: A list of integers.\n\n        Returns:\n            The maximum sum of any contiguous subarray.\n\n        Time Complexity:\n            O(n), where n is the number of elements in the input list.\n        \"\"\"\n        # Initialize current_max and max_so_far with the first element\n        current_max = max_so_far = nums[0]\n\n        # Iterate through the list starting from the second element\n        for num in nums[1:]:\n            # Update current_max to be the maximum of the current number or current_max + current number\n            current_max = max(num, current_max + num)\n            # Update max_so_far to be the maximum of itself or current_max\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n        return max_so_far\n```",
